{"f59b84ef": "数|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ff80d1ad": "空|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e424c1bf": "靠|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "75607c6f": "仰|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "911c6016": "颗|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c060f280": "久|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0093b740": "清|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5a308081": "连|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7f5a402d": "勺|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "be7bb25a": "离|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "af5a8bbd": "努|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9e5a70fa": "力|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d13c40d6": "著|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f33426e4": "反文旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1feecca4": "穴宝盖|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3b9568d5": "非字底|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0e3b57ed": "单人旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e53cb14c": "页字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "829c62e6": "撇|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c92bc8e9": "三点水|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fee4e53b": "走之底|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1bb36d93": "包字头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "de21f860": "京字头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5bf17e66": "力字底|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2ff91822": "力字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4cbd3ec7": "草字头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6dafb8ad": "小狗从门口跑进来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "69d7adc6": "哥哥爬上去了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1f13f9eb": "妈妈把月饼拿出来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "411d0167": "弟弟跑上来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4e6a59ec": "小鸟飞出去了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a238f7a6": "小鸟飞了出去。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0ab85f47": "姐姐走进来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3d4adea1": "我把望远镜拿出来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "149c41cb": "我把望远镜拿了出来。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b5d4a52f": "妹妹慢慢地走下来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "886c7a67": "妹妹慢慢地走了下来。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2d60e4ab": "数学|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6c1f60dd": "数星星|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b5bdeeda": "天空|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9327772a": "靠近|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "215ace41": "仰头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7cdbd205": "一颗星|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d683f676": "很久|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "02c6a2ee": "清楚|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "68b66465": "连起来|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f7d945c7": "勺子|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3716a4ae": "离开|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3203d6d2": "努力|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "35db8aaa": "力气|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3c94d4c1": "著名|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b5d27c28": "上个星期天，爸爸带我去参观了一个著名的天文馆。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a5782d5f": "天文馆的屋顶像一片天空，上面有好多星星。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e3103ea8": "我们靠在椅子上，仰头看星星。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "31f60ae1": "我看见一颗星特别亮，就问爸爸它叫什么。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bcf8c924": "我在纸上画小点，再把小点连起来，画出了一只小熊。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c275fa8e": "天文馆的小商店里有星星样子的勺子，我买了一把送给奶奶。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d25fa3fd": "我们在天文馆里待了很久，一点儿也不想走。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cc859195": "城市里的灯太亮了，要离开城市才能看到很多星星。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ab824663": "晚上回到家，我们站在阳台上，月亮看得很清楚。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4e5ad1d4": "我真想靠近星星看一看，可是它们离我们太远了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0d666f36": "我要好好学数学，长大了去研究星星。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "37ffff0a": "爸爸说，你们宇航员每天都要锻炼，所以很有力气。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e3ddcc39": "我每天都会努力锻炼身体，以后也去太空看一看！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "aa62c49d": "这就是著名的天文馆，我们进去吧！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "13103bba": "哇，圆圆的屋顶变成了一片天空，满天都是星星！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "aa732eab": "这里的椅子可以往后靠，你仰起头，就能看清楚整个屋顶了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1f53f4bb": "我来数一数！我已经数到五十颗了，星星一颗连着一颗，还有好多呢！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9e097749": "有的星星离我们特别远，它们的光要走很久很久，才能照到地球。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4458ee3e": "我长大了要当宇航员，坐着飞船飞上去，再飞下来告诉你！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "71202a79": "那你要努力学习，还要有力气。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "81839768": "好！那我今天晚饭要吃三大勺米饭，多长力气！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1ade6237": "数一数|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5c612ea8": "数字|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f0aaaa3b": "空气|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b77b1680": "空中|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "98130809": "靠背|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e6b3475a": "可靠|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3a4b379c": "仰望|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "623a2594": "仰泳|zh-CN-Xiaoxi